WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
<v Nadia Farouk>Follow-up on the ticketing tool. A few changes.</v>

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:10.500
<v José García>The High priority first response target changes from four hours to two hours.</v>

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
<v José García>Auto-assignment now also covers Medium priority tickets, not just High.</v>

4
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:21.000
<v Nadia Farouk>Big one. Let's drop the Low priority tier entirely. Everything is Medium or High.</v>

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:25.000
<v José García>Understood, no more Low priority. Medium and High only from now on.</v>

6
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.500
<v Nadia Farouk>The email to the requester on every status change, that stays as is.</v>

7
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.500
<v José García>Under no circumstances shall a ticket be permanently deleted; it is only ever archived.</v>

8
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:41.000
<v Nadia Farouk>Good. New thing: after a ticket is closed, send the requester a satisfaction survey.</v>

9
00:00:41.500 --> 00:00:44.500
<v José García>A post-closure satisfaction survey, noted.</v>

10
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.000
<v Nadia Farouk>On the reopen question from last week, did you settle it?</v>

11
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:53.000
<v José García>Still checking. I'll have an answer before call three.</v>

12
00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:56.000
<v Nadia Farouk>Fine. Coffee's ready, let's wrap up here.</v>
